This parameter is required.'),
          vpcId: string(name='vpcId', description='The VPC ID.

This parameter is required.', example='vpc-bp1234567890'),
        }(name='vpc', description='The user VPC and vSwitch list used for deploying the collaboration plugin. The zones corresponding to the vSwitches are queried by the server and do not need to be provided by the user.'),
      }(name='network', description='The network configuration used by the collaboration plugin. If not specified, the server uses the existing network configuration of the workspace.'),
    }(name='config', description='The plugin-specific configuration. The configuration structure is determined by pluginName. Currently, the collaboration plugin supports network.'),
